{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53210","headline":"诗偈 三十五 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云何爲人演，离相说如如，心镜俱空静，无实亦无虚。\n心通常嘿用，出世入无余。\n梵释咸恭敬，菩萨亦同居。\n语是凡夫语，理合释迦书。\n若能如是学，不枉用功夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}